* ASTM F2503, *Standard Practice for Marking Medical Devices and Other Items for Safety in the Magnetic Resonance Environment*.
* Kanal E. et al., "ACR guidance document on MR safe practices", *J. Magn. Reson. Imaging* (2013).
* McRobbie D. W., Moore E. A., Graves M. J., Prince M. R., *MRI from Picture to Proton*, Cambridge University Press (chapter on safety).
